eft 2\r\nWINDOW 3 24 96 Left 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Vcm\r\nSYMATTR Value 0\r\nTEXT -64 880 Left 2 ;Without Ccp and Ccn the CMFB loop has two poles close together (the outputs and the sense node cm, loaded by Q7): the CM margin is only about 15°.\\nIn CM the probe breaks every loop that goes through the outputs: the CMFB and the R2 feedback (small in CM: the tail rejects it).\r\nTEXT -64 960 Left 2 ;.stb LP1 cm dec 50 1k 10g\r\n",
