eft 2\r\nWINDOW 3 24 96 Left 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Vcm\r\nSYMATTR Value 0\r\nTEXT -64 880 Left 2 ;LP2 breaks only the CMFB loop; the R2 feedback stays closed inside it. It sees T2/(1 + T1) instead of T1 + T2:\\nabout 4 dB less at low frequency than LP1 in CM, with the same crossover and margin, because the pair barely amplifies the common mode.\\nWith a weak tail (a resistor, not a current source) T1 grows and the two probes drift apart.\r\nTEXT -64 984 Left 2 ;.stb LP2 dec 50 1k 10g\r\n",
